>:  Hi Sally!  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi Vanessa! Did you read my articles about gender issues in Cambridge LIfe?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, I'm reading the online version now. I've got to finish reading the last one.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What do you think?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, you bring up some interesting ideas. In my opinion, the most important issue you talk about is the wage gap.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Everyone is going to have to work together if we want to solve this problem."}, {"time": "22500", "image": "engenn6le13ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're right. I also liked the article about who talks more. I thought women were more social, but sometimes men are more outgoing.   </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I learned a lot about the changing family, and how women with infants and toddlers are going back to work sooner than before."}, {"time": "36900", "image": "engenn6le13ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, but eating habits in the family haven't changed that much. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're right. Women consistently spend more time in the kitchen than men.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: One day, that will change. It will be a sweet victory!  What are you going to write about next?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure yet. I've got to think about it!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le13ob11re5aud01"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le13ob11re6aud01"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 3, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Gender Issues"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Sweet Victory"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 13}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le13ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Superlatives and Comparatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use comparative adjectives to compare yourself to another      person.    </br>You use a superlative adjectives to compare yourself or          something to a group of people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some adjectives change to different words in the comparative and       superlative form. </br>  With one syllable words, you add <span class=\"strong\">-er</span> to the adjective to make the       comparative form. You add <span class=\"strong\">-est</span> to the adjective to make the         superlative form.</br>     With words of two or more syllables, you add the word <span class=\"italic\">more</span> before          the adjective or adverb in the comparative form. You add <span class=\"italic\">the most</span>      before the adjective or the adverb in the superlative form."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective or Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worse\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"hard\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"harder\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the hardest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"soon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sooner\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the soonest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"social\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more social\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most social\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"outgoing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more outgoing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most outgoing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"accurately\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"most accurately\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most accurately\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I thought women were more social, but sometimes men are more outgoing.   "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Women with infants and toddlers are going back to work sooner than before."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing What is Necessary"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use certain expressions to talk about what is necessary to do in the future in order for something to happen."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What are you going to write about next?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure yet. I've got to think about it!"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>You have to...</li> <li>You have got to\u2026</li> <li>I'm going to have to\u2026</li> <li>You need to\u2026</li></ul>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "social "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes a person who enjoys talking to people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I always thought women were more social."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "infant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "baby"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I learned how women with infants are going back to work sooner than before."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "toddler"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a young child"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Mothers with toddlers are also going back to work."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wage gap"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the difference in salary between two groups of people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In my opinion, the most important issue you talk about is the wage gap."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gender "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "sex (male or female)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you read my articles about gender issues in Cambridge LIfe?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob11aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "consistently"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "regularly; repeatedly; on a regular basis"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Women consistently spend more time in the kitchen than men."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le13ob11aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of the gender issues discussed in this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss the issues with 10 people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask each person to identify the 3 most important issues."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compile (count) the results of your survey."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present the results to the class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I review the gender issues in this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss gender issues with 10 people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I survey opinions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present the results of the survey."}]}]}